## SQ-RDX-01 | Rustic member (baked): no recipe or NCH error
@group A
@commands (RERUN: nested jar 2026-11-02, run plan in SQ-CDJ5) Boot; `grep -n "rusticdelight\|Rustic Delight upstream" logs/latest.log \| grep -i "error\|exception\|data:" \| head`; `grep -n "rusticdelight\|pizza\|golden_coffee" logs/kubejs/server.log \| grep -i "error\|warn" \| head`
@pass "Rustic Delight upstream data: N files" line; no recipe parse error; no `incomplete(...) not registered`; no NCH warning
@fails missing incomplete key in transition_items.js; translator REPLACED broke a JSON
@from batches/r1113/c4_a.qb passed
bootreject (?i)rusticdelight.*(parse error|exception)
bootreject incomplete\(.*\) not registered
kjsreject (?i)(rusticdelight|pizza|golden_coffee).*(error|warn)
kjsreject (?i)\[NCH\].*warn

## SQ-RDX-02
@group A
@commands JEI search "Pancake", "Fried Dough"; hover Supplementaries' pancake
@pass No Rustic plain Pancake or Fried Dough; Supplementaries' item is named "Pancake" with gray "Stackable: place up to 8 ..." line; the six flavored Rustic pancakes still listed
